{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Tanks 3D",
    "steam_appid": 3769250,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against up to 1,000 other real players concurrently clashing as tanks as part of a giant army, on a massive, fully destructible battlefield. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769250/extras/7893cd91c6d63171f7b1628e2aca9a5f.avif?t=1748962654\" width=600 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a highly maneuverable battle Tank in first or third person, with controls similar to a standard FPS.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on servers up to 1000 players concurrently on giant maps with destructible terrain,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the terrain building large mountain defenses or carving deep trenches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture battlefield land to increase your army's passive reinforcement rate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the other armies by obliterating their tanks and troops, and pushing into their land.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up and gain access to multiple weapons including cluster bombs, MIRVs and mortars as well as other tank types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alongside giant mechs and other machines of war.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join in game Clans, and make friends playing with regulars.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769250/extras/8eea00b3a6261c43898fb2041dee95d4.avif?t=1748962654\" width=600 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769250/extras/07d6162983d127c200281f1a3e401b87.avif?t=1748962654\" width=600 height=600 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play against up to 1,000 other real players concurrently clashing as tanks as part of a giant army, on a massive, fully destructible battlefield. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769250/extras/7893cd91c6d63171f7b1628e2aca9a5f.avif?t=1748962654\" width=600 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a highly maneuverable battle Tank in first or third person, with controls similar to a standard FPS.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play on servers up to 1000 players concurrently on giant maps with destructible terrain,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape the terrain building large mountain defenses or carving deep trenches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture battlefield land to increase your army's passive reinforcement rate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy the other armies by obliterating their tanks and troops, and pushing into their land.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up and gain access to multiple weapons including cluster bombs, MIRVs and mortars as well as other tank types.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alongside giant mechs and other machines of war.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join in game Clans, and make friends playing with regulars.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769250/extras/8eea00b3a6261c43898fb2041dee95d4.avif?t=1748962654\" width=600 height=600 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769250/extras/07d6162983d127c200281f1a3e401b87.avif?t=1748962654\" width=600 height=600 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Play as a highly maneuverable battle Tank against up to 1,000 other real players concurrently, clashing as part of a giant army, on a massive, fully destructible battlefield. Capture land to win the war.\u00a0Tanks 3D is a multiplayer PVP game that can be played in first or third person.",
